data:{"type":"ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT","runId":"r1","threadId":"vision-b-layout2","timestamp":1786768844992,"messageId":"a2ui-v-layout2","activityType":"a2ui-surface","content":{"a2ui_operations":[{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"v-layout2","catalogId":"https://opencode-agui-app.local/a2ui/data-agent-catalog.json"}},{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"v-layout2","components":[{"component":"Column","id":"root","children":["card","tabs","modal"]},{"component":"Card","id":"card","child":"cardInner"},{"component":"Column","id":"cardInner","children":["row","divider","list"]},{"component":"Row","id":"row","children":["textLeft","textRight"],"justify":"space-between"},{"component":"Text","id":"textLeft","text":"左侧文本"},{"component":"Text","id":"textRight","text":"右侧文本"},{"component":"Divider","id":"divider"},{"component":"List","id":"list","children":["li1","li2","li3"]},{"component":"Text","id":"li1","text":"列表项 1"},{"component":"Text","id":"li2","text":"列表项 2"},{"component":"Text","id":"li3","text":"列表项 3"},{"component":"Tabs","id":"tabs","tabs":[{"title":"页签一","child":"tab1"},{"title":"页签二","child":"tab2"}]},{"component":"Text","id":"tab1","text":"页签一内容"},{"component":"Text","id":"tab2","text":"页签二内容"},{"component":"Modal","id":"modal","trigger":"modalTrigger","content":"modalContent"},{"component":"Button","id":"modalTrigger","child":"modalTriggerText"},{"component":"Text","id":"modalTriggerText","text":"打开弹窗"},{"component":"Text","id":"modalContent","text":"这是弹窗内容"}]}}]},"replace":true}

data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-b-layout2","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_003b8c001001iFf4D2LO7Iz5aO","role":"user","content":"请用 render_a2ui 渲染一个 surface（surfaceId=v-layout2）：Column 根，里面依次放 一个 Card（内含一个 Row 两个 Text 左右分布、一条 Divider、一个 List 3 个 Text 项）、一个 Tabs（两个页签各一个 Text）、一个 Modal（trigger 是 Button 打开，content 是 Text）。不要渲染其他组件。"},{"id":"msg_003b8c036001ggAIrHKrSTfVXJ-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to render a surface using render_a2ui. Let me follow the exact structure they requested.\n\nSurfaceId: v-layout2\nRoot: Column\nContents in order:\n1. A Card containing a Row with two Texts (left-right distribution), a Divider, a List with 3 Text items\n2. A Tabs with two tabs each containing a Text\n3. A Modal with trigger being a Button, content being a Text\n\nLet me construct the components array carefully. All components are flat, children reference by id, root id must be \"root\".\n\nComponents:\n- Column (root) with children: [card, tabs, modal]\n- Card (card) with child: cardContent\n- Column or Row... wait, Card takes child: id (single). So I need a container inside the card. Let me think - the card contains a Row, a Divider, a List. Since Card takes a single child, I need to wrap them. Could use a Column inside the card. Let me use a Column.\n\nWait, but the requirement says \"Card（内含一个 Row 两个 Text 左右分布、一条 Divider、一个 List 3 个 Text 项）\". So inside Card: Row with two texts, Divider, List with 3 texts. I'll wrap in a Column.\n\nComponents list:\n1. Column id=root, children=[\"card\", \"tabs\", \"modal\"]\n2. Card id=\"card\", child=\"cardInner\"\n3. Column id=\"cardInner\", children=[\"row\", \"divider\", \"list\"]\n4. Row id=\"row\", children=[\"textLeft\", \"textRight\"], justify=\"space-between\"\n5. Text id=\"textLeft\", text=\"...\"\n6. Text id=\"textRight\", text=\"...\"\n7. Divider id=\"divider\"\n8. List id=\"list\", children=[\"li1\", \"li2\", \"li3\"]\n9. Text id=\"li1\"\n10. Text id=\"li2\"\n11. Text id=\"li3\"\n12. Tabs id=\"tabs\", tabs=[{title:\"页签1\", child:\"tab1\"}, {title:\"页签2\", child:\"tab2\"}]\n13. Text id=\"tab1\"\n14. Text id=\"tab2\"\n15. Modal id=\"modal\", trigger=\"modalTrigger\", content=\"modalContent\"\n16. Button id=\"modalTrigger\", child=\"modalTriggerText\"\n17. Text id=\"modalTriggerText\"\n18. Text id=\"modalContent\"\n\nWait - does Modal have trigger and content props? The description says: \"Modal{trigger:id,content:id}\". Yes.\n\nButton: \"Button{child:文本组件id,variant?,action:{event:{name,context?}}}\". So child is a text component id.\n\nRow: \"Row/Column/List{children:[id],justify?,align?}\". So Row has children and justify. \"justify\" - I'll use \"space-between\" for left-right distribution. Actually the prop values... likely CSS justify-content values like \"space-between\", \"flex-start\", etc. Let me use \"space-between\".\n\nLet me just render it. Keep response short."},{"id":"msg_003b8c036001ggAIrHKrSTfVXJ","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_n1pFZJyaCIUE6gpVSCTP7225","type":"function","function":{"name":"render_a2ui","arguments":"{\"surfaceId\":\"v-layout2\",\"components\":[{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"root\",\"children\":[\"card\",\"tabs\",\"modal\"]},{\"component\":\"Card\",\"id\":\"card\",\"child\":\"cardInner\"},{\"component\":\"Column\",\"id\":\"cardInner\",\"children\":[\"row\",\"divider\",\"list\"]},{\"component\":\"Row\",\"id\":\"row\",\"children\":[\"textLeft\",\"textRight\"],\"justify\":\"space-between\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"textLeft\",\"text\":\"左侧文本\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"textRight\",\"text\":\"右侧文本\"},{\"component\":\"Divider\",\"id\":\"divider\"},{\"component\":\"List\",\"id\":\"list\",\"children\":[\"li1\",\"li2\",\"li3\"]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"li1\",\"text\":\"列表项 1\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"li2\",\"text\":\"列表项 2\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"li3\",\"text\":\"列表项 3\"},{\"component\":\"Tabs\",\"id\":\"tabs\",\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"页签一\",\"child\":\"tab1\"},{\"title\":\"页签二\",\"child\":\"tab2\"}]},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"tab1\",\"text\":\"页签一内容\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"tab2\",\"text\":\"页签二内容\"},{\"component\":\"Modal\",\"id\":\"modal\",\"trigger\":\"modalTrigger\",\"content\":\"modalContent\"},{\"component\":\"Button\",\"id\":\"modalTrigger\",\"child\":\"modalTriggerText\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"modalTriggerText\",\"text\":\"打开弹窗\"},{\"component\":\"Text\",\"id\":\"modalContent\",\"text\":\"这是弹窗内容\"}]}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_n1pFZJyaCIUE6gpVSCTP7225","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_n1pFZJyaCIUE6gpVSCTP7225","content":"UI surface \"v-layout2\" rendered (18 components). The user can already see it; do NOT paste the JSON back into chat."},{"id":"msg_003b8e23d001Xn21NGjxqDdEdc","role":"assistant","content":"已渲染 surface `v-layout2`，包含 Card（Row 两 Text 左右分布 + Divider + List 三项）、Tabs（两个页签）、Modal（Button 触发）。"}]}

